     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation OCTMaculaLeftEyeExample2</b></p><a name=\"OCTMaculaLeftEyeExample2\"> </a><a name=\"hcOCTMaculaLeftEyeExample2\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ophthalmic-oct-macula.html\">Ophthalmic OCT Macula</a></p></div><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category exam}\">Exam</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 57119-0}\">OCT macula analysis</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-PatientExample.html\">Patient Example  Female, DoB: 1990-01-01 ( Passport number: PA1234567)</a></p><p><b>effective</b>: 2026-08-18 09:00:00+0000</p><p><b>performer</b>: <a href=\"Practitioner-OphthalmologistExample.html\">Practitioner Ophthalmologist Example </a></p><p><b>interpretation</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://YasniiSS.github.io/fhir4eyes/CodeSystem/fhir4eyes-cs within-normal-limits}\">Within normal limits</span></p><p><b>note</b>: </p><blockquote><div><p>Device: Heidelberg Spectralis SPIRIT tracking laser tomography</p>\n</div></blockquote><p><b>bodySite</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\"></span></p><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 57109-1}\">Central macular thickness (CMT)</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 271 um<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codeum = 'um')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 57108-3}\">Center thickness</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 238 um<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codeum = 'um')</span></p></blockquote><blockquo